CodeMind — Licensing
====================

Copyright (c) FWKTechnologies. All rights reserved except as expressly granted
by the license of each version.

Each version of CodeMind has its OWN license. A version's license
applies only to that version and to works derived from it:

  CodeMind 1.0  ->  licenses/LICENSE-CodeMind-1.0.md
  CodeMind 2.0  ->  licenses/LICENSE-CodeMind-2.0.md
  CodeMind 3.0  ->  licenses/LICENSE-CodeMind-3.0.md

CodeMind 1.0 is NOT released. Its license is an ACCESS license:
  - The model is not downloadable and is not distributed in any form, and the
    public codemindai-api library cannot run it.
  - It can be used only through access granted by FWKTechnologies (for
    example an API key to its server), including commercially inside your
    own websites, applications and API services.
  - Copying, modifying, sharing, selling or reselling the model, or reselling
    or sharing access to it, is not allowed.
  - Any copy of CodeMind 1.0 not obtained from FWKTechnologies in writing is
    unlicensed.

CodeMind 2.0 and 3.0 are released. Their licenses are MODEL licenses:
  - Commercial use is allowed for running your own services on websites,
    in applications and through APIs.
  - Modifying the model is allowed.
  - Sharing the model or a modified version is allowed only free of charge,
    as open source, under the same license.
  - Selling the model or any modified version, in any form, is not allowed.
  - Public services must meet the safety and responsibility duties (3.0 adds
    transparency and security duties).

Common to all three:
  - Credit to the main developer is always required:
        Built with CodeMind <version> by FWKTechnologies
        https://github.com/FWKTechnologies/CodeMind-Code-Intelligence

The documents in docs/ describe the models; they are not licenses, and the
CodeMind 1.0 document does not make CodeMind 1.0 available. If a
summary anywhere differs from a version's license file, the license file
governs.
